\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {43.3}{\ignorespaces Indradhanu Heavy's pretraining, all 80 epochs drawn from \texttt {metrics.csv} \,{\footnotesize \leavevmode {\color {gray}[M:\,\url@ttstyle \url {F002-heavy/metrics.csv}]}}. Train L1 lies above validation L1 throughout (see the text), and both keep falling.\relax }}{659}{figure.caption.504}%
