\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {44.1}{\ignorespaces The publication schematic of the namer, from \texttt {research/\allowbreak experiments/\allowbreak spectral-namer/\allowbreak figures/\allowbreak namer\_network.pdf}, redrawn on 31\nobreakspace {}October 2026 for level\nobreakspace {}1 by matching: the pixel tower has two heads (embedding and fill), and the class-matching box pools the natural library entries as one more class, $P(\text {man-made})=\sigma (\operatorname {LSE}_{c<7}S_c-S_{\text {natural}}+b)$ (\cref {sec:namer:level1}, \cref {fig:namer:shapes}). The old Linear level-1 head is still built in the model but not used, so it is not drawn.\relax }}{672}{figure.caption.514}%
